{"3665870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Iron Stars", "steam_appid": 3665870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Iron Stars</strong>, you lead a growing spacefaring civilization across realistic star systems inspired by real astronomy. Each system contains planets and moons with meaningful physical properties: gravity, atmosphere, temperature, habitability, resources, and orbital context.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your empire expands through industry. Colonies produce resources, populations grow over time, and every world can serve a purpose. Fertile planets become population centers. Barren worlds become mining colonies. Icy moons provide fuel and volatiles. Harsh planets may be difficult to settle, but they can still become vital parts of your industrial machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your civilization grows, you must decide which worlds to colonize, how to specialize them, and how to balance population, production, resources, and expansion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iron Stars</strong> combines realistic space simulation, strategic empire building, and industrial expansion into a game about scale, planning, and the transformation of hostile space into civilization.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Iron Stars</strong>, you lead a growing spacefaring civilization across realistic star systems inspired by real astronomy. Each system contains planets and moons with meaningful physical properties: gravity, atmosphere, temperature, habitability, resources, and orbital context.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your empire expands through industry. Colonies produce resources, populations grow over time, and every world can serve a purpose. Fertile planets become population centers. Barren worlds become mining colonies. Icy moons provide fuel and volatiles. Harsh planets may be difficult to settle, but they can still become vital parts of your industrial machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your civilization grows, you must decide which worlds to colonize, how to specialize them, and how to balance population, production, resources, and expansion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iron Stars</strong> combines realistic space simulation, strategic empire building, and industrial expansion into a game about scale, planning, and the transformation of hostile space into civilization.</p>", "short_description": "Iron Stars is a realistic space 4X strategy game where you explore believable star systems, colonize planets and moons, grow your population, and turn entire solar systems into industrial empires.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665870/dc3abfd28f94b13584c2048e7c9fa63b85005b9a/header.jpg?t=1788073701", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665870/3c04248095b4e2360a958e7075a156e3cdc4e7d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788073701", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665870/3c04248095b4e2360a958e7075a156e3cdc4e7d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788073701", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit, version 21H1 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400F or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6 GB or AMD Radeon RX 580 8 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1080p low target. Large galaxies are CPU Intensive</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 22H2 or Windows 11, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong